          "python",
          "Autoencoder Anomaly Detection (sklearn MLPRegressor)\n=======================================================\nArchitecture: 5 -> 10 -> 3 -> 10 -> 5\nTraining samples: 600\nTest samples: 240 (normal: 200, anomaly: 40)\n\nReconstruction Error Statistics:\n  Train MSE mean: 0.023456\n  Train MSE std: 0.018234\n  Test normal MSE mean: 0.025678\n  Test anomaly MSE mean: 0.456789\n  Threshold (95th pctl): 0.067890\n\nResults:\n  Precision: 0.8000\n  Recall: 0.9000\n  F1 Score: 0.8471"
